From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: the taskbar's input indicator, as Windows 10's (9162)

With two keyboards or more Windows 10's taskbar shows, left of the clock,
the input language the foreground window types with -- "ENG", "DEU"; with
two keyboards of one language the keyboard under it, "ENG" over "US". A
click lists the keyboards (the language's abbreviation, the language's
name, "<keyboard> keyboard"), the one in use marked, picks one, and ends
with "Language preferences". The Windows logo key + Space shows the same
list while the key is held, moving down it at each Space (Shift: up).
Ours had none: a person with two keyboards could not see which one typed.

- inputind.c: TrayInputIndicatorWClass, a child of the taskbar between the
  notification icons and the clock (they make room for it: the clock's
  length becomes the clock's and the indicator's), its tooltip ("English
  (United States) / US keyboard / To switch input methods, press the Start
  key + Space."), the list (SgInputSwitcher). It follows HSHELL_LANGUAGE
  (9160) -- switches made with the keyboard, by programs, from the list --
  and reads the keyboards again each second (Settings adds and removes
  them). A pick activates the layout while the list is in front (the
  session's keyboard switches, 9156), asks the window that was in front to
  take it (WM_INPUTLANGCHANGEREQUEST to its focus window, as Windows'
  switcher does) and gives it the foreground back. Win+Space and
  Shift+Win+Space are the shell's hotkeys: the display server switches the
  keyboard itself (grp:win_space_toggle); the list shows where it went.
- The language's abbreviation is its own name's first three letters for
  Latin, Greek and Cyrillic scripts (ENG, DEU, FRA, ESP, SVE, РУС), else the
  ISO 639-2 code; the keyboard's name is Windows' (Keyboard Layouts\KLID
  "Layout Text", looked up by Layout Id for a variant's F00x HKL).
- wine.inf: Windows' Layout Text of the base layouts (only the variants
  had one).

Gate test/inputind-gate.sh (Xvfb, us,de, explorer's taskbar, XTEST keys,
xdotool clicks). Mutants SG_MUTANT_IND_IGNORE_SHELL, SG_MUTANT_IND_NO_HOTKEY,
SG_MUTANT_IND_PICK_NOTHING, SG_MUTANT_IND_NO_ROOM.
